          "issue": "The main rendering defensibly takes τῆς κατὰ σάρκα as the genitive of comparison and attaches χείρονος ὑπαρχούσης to spiritual adultery. However, the sequence also permits taking τῆς κατὰ σάρκα as the subject of a genitive absolute: ‘adultery according to the flesh being worse.’ That materially different comparison is not disclosed in the notes.",
